{"ticker":"PATANJALI","symbol":"PATANJALI","instrumentId":3023136,"name":"Patanjali Foods","industry":"NSE-Food-Misc Preparation","about":"Patanjali Foods Ltd., a prominent player in India’s fast-moving consumer goods (FMCG) sector, specializes in edible oils, food products, and nutraceuticals. The company’s product portfolio includes refined oils, packaged foods, Ayurvedic health supplements, and dairy products. With a strong emphasis on natural and Ayurvedic-based products, Patanjali Foods caters to health-conscious consumers seeking healthier alternatives. The company leverages Patanjali’s extensive distribution network to reach urban and rural markets across India. Its focus on sustainability, purity, and the promotion of indigenous products has positioned it as a trusted brand, contributing to the growing demand for natural and organic food products.","website":"www.patanjalifoods.com","location":"Mumbai, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:47:55.556Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":402,"changePct":0.24937655860349126,"week52High":584.25,"week52Low":336.15},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹43,742 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹44,299 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"348,194,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"179"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"214,914,571"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.07%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"3.34"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"2.4"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.13"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.87"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"15%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"23.33"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"23–59"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"13.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-3.06"},{"label":"Volume","value":"1,486,292"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"4,931,745"},{"label":"Master score","value":"46"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"60"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"45"},{"label